name njuvisual
category Package
revision 61555
shortdesc Display logos related to Nanjing University
longdesc The njuvisual package collects standard colors and logos
longdesc related to Nanjing University, saves the vector logos as TikZ
longdesc pictures and provides a user-friendly interface to display them
longdesc in documents and beamers.
